[00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:45.720]   strategies only to blow up, spectacularly in the end, often wiping out thanks to leverage
[00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:50.260]   in a single day the sum total of their profits over a period of years. My favorite example
[00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:55.240]   from the book is a simple one, which he calls "The Mysterious Letter," paid 27. Suppose
[00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:59.680]   you open an anonymous letter on January 2 that says the market will go up during January,
[00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:03.460]   and it proves to be true. Then you receive another letter on February 1 saying the market
[00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:08.240]   will decline, which also proves to be true. This continues each month. By July, you are
