[00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:20.440]   your money is all gone and that weeks later your money is all gone and that you've been.
[00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:25.840]   What happened? In January, the con man pulls 10,000 names from a phone book. He mails a
[00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:29.840]   bullish letter to half the list and a bearish letter to the other half. The next month he
[00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:33.260]   mails only those who received the correct prediction, sending half a bullish prediction
