[00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:58.640]   Much to my surprise and pleasure, he covers the very real, increasing returns that can
[00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:03.620]   result from chance luck. While traders will, in my opinion, rarely see these benefits,
[00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:08.320]   some types of financial firms might. For example, assume 10 equally skilled venture capital
[00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:13.380]   partnerships all start at the same time. After 10 years, assume a distribution of results
