[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.760]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from April 24, 2008, titled "User Conferences,
[00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.280]   Pigs, Wigs, and Lipstick." I've been traveling a lot recently,
