[00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:15.280]   a set of results that has both depth and breadth, e. So Quill searches the web for pages with your
[00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:20.080]   keywords and then we analyze the rest of the text on those pages. This tells us that the same word
