[00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:34.120]   Fewer startups run the gauntlet to IPO and I think that's the rice startups.
[00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:37.600]   Run the gauntlet to IPO and I think that's the result of three things.
[00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:43.480]   The socks, tax, an estimated $2 million, $3 million annual nut, which all but wipes out
