[00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:24.960]   in 1Q09 and 2008, so how does this jibe with the 50/50/0 model? They're on target with respect to
[00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:29.920]   size good. They're high on growth rate, good, but it's decelerating, bad, but then again it's
[00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:34.880]   subscription very good. They're low on operating income, bad, good plus good plus bad plus very
