[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.680]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from June 29, 2009 titled "Kedrosky,
[00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:10.080]   VC, will be cut in half." I just finished reading Right Sizing the US Venture Capital
[00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.840]   Industry by Paul Kedrosky, author of the Infectious Greed blog, and wanted to share
[00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.600]   some thoughts on it here. He starts with an interesting swipe at two of the more popular
[00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.440]   claims of venture industry marketing, one the citation of great successes such as Google,
[00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:26.400]   Microsoft, Starbucks, and Cisco, and two the NBCA claim that venture-backed companies represent
