[00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.080]   demonstrated that the company could not have obtained that service elsewhere. There are many
[00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:40.560]   providers of risk capital, and a smaller venture industry, or a larger one, might well have had as
[00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:45.360]   much success, or more, at funding the same companies. He moves on to analyze venture capital
[00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:50.400]   performance, noting that historical annual returns were about 20% and arguing that the 10-year numbers
