[00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:15.840]   One key reason I joined Mark Logic was that, in some way, I agree with Siebel.
[00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:20.440]   We are hitting diminishing marginal returns, not on IT overall, but instead on what we
