[00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:29.680]   the last 20 years of my management career. Let's make this concrete. To assess whether someone keeps
[00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:34.560]   up, I increasingly ask myself one question. Do I want to talk to Person X about Problem Y?
[00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:38.960]   There are three primary reasons why I wouldn't want to talk to Person X about Problem Y.
[00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:43.920]   Person X doesn't understand Problem Y. It's not interesting to talk to him/her because all I do
[00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:48.720]   is educate him on the problem. It is not a stimulating two-way exchange of ideas. Person
[00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:53.440]   X doesn't say anything interesting about Problem Y. Person X understands the problem, but doesn't
