[00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:02.960]   Person X says interesting things about Problem Y, but never follows through on agreements made
[00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:08.640]   during the discussion. Big talker. Or, to use the Texas equivalent, big hat, no cattle.
