[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.440]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from March 11, 2011 titled "Business Strategy
[00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.440]   and the Wrong Medicine." Let's say you're not feeling well, so you visit the doctor,
