[00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:19.440]   on 105 Mg of Synthroid." You say, "What? You have even examined me yet. I'm starting you
[00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.800]   on thyroid hormones because the patient before you had Hashimoto's disease."
