[00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.520]   environment. In a K-S-E-S-A, sick escalation of commitment error, when Ingress got into deep
[00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:28.080]   trouble rather than abandoning Ingress and switching horses to Oracle, Ask chose to acquire
