[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.760]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from March 23, 2012 titled "The Simple,
[00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:10.560]   Definitive, One-Step Hot Market Test." Founders, entrepreneurs, venture capitalists,
[00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.040]   and startup employees often spend a lot of time wondering, worrying, and pondering if
