[00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:05.360]   changing markets is as easy as putting mobile A big data social analytics ellipsoid on the
[00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:10.160]   proverbial pig. Because the prospect of not being in a hot or soon-to-be hot market is too grim to
[00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.960]   ponder and/or too politically incorrect an assertion to state, companies tend to always
[00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:19.440]   assume that they are in a hot market. I remember visiting an empty building with two guys sitting
