[00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:35.040]   evidently it had been deleted. I looked at my blog roll and saw, nicely tucked within the links that
[00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:39.600]   were supposed to be there, numerous links that weren't. I read one of my top posts which now
[00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:44.640]   had a reference to. Best auto loans jammed in the middle of an otherwise normal sentence,
[00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:48.400]   so someone hacked into the blog, deleted the post, saying it was closed,
[00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:53.600]   subtly inserted spam links into top posts, and did an occasional repost to keep things fresh.
