[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from August 16, 2013 titled, "Sales
[00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.420]   is from Mars and engineering is from Venus."
[00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:11.780]   I was talking to a startup CEO the other day and he said, "Sales is from Mars, engineering
