[00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:33.900]   Avoid the blame game.
[00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.560]   Your e-staff is one team and you win or lose together.
[00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:39.320]   If they're fighting, it's either because they're bad folks and need replacement,
[00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.580]   or they're good folks and they are not aligned on the mission.
[00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:46.120]   The communication problem with sales and engineering founder/technical CEO's love to reason.
[00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:47.480]   They are reluctant to bark orders.
[00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:51.020]   Instead, they prefer to lay out options and debate merits, eventually arising at consensus
