[00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:57.120]   That style tends to work well with engineers and marketers.
[00:01:57.120 --> 00:01:59.600]   It tends to work far less well with sales.
[00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:02.960]   At the same time, you might be thinking, "Gosh, I'm doing such a great job reasoning
