[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.160]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from January 25, 2014 titled "Is Salesforce
[00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:11.040]   C. Siebel a Classic Disruption Case?" Like many others, I have often used Salesforce/Siebel
[00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:15.760]   as a classic example of innovator's dilemma style disruption. Several months ago, in response to
[00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.680]   this article about host analytics, I received a friendly note from former Siebel exec and now
[00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:25.040]   venture capitalist Bruce Cleveland saying roughly "nice PR piece, but the Salesforce/Siebel disruption
