[00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:34.080]   in a Fortune article, "Lessons from the Death of a Tech Giant." In addition, he posted some
[00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:39.360]   supplemental thoughts in a blog post "Siebel vs Salesforce, Lessons from the Death of a Tech Giant."
