[00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:21.920]   of Siebel left Salesforce unopposed for eight years? To what extent was that true in the other
[00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:28.080]   categories in which ORAC? Le made large acquisitions, for example, HCM, metalware? After hearing both
[00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:32.000]   sides of the argument, to what extent do you believe the reality of the case is Salesforce
