[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from March 5, 2014 titled,
[00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.400]   "The old don't bring up a problem unless you have a solution. Rule."
[00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.680]   There's a rule out there, circulated widely as conventional wisdom,
[00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.680]   that you should never bring up a problem in the workplace unless you have a proposed solution.
[00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:19.520]   For example, consider the following excerpt from this ink magazine article,
