[00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:46.240]   violates my "do it in the meeting" principle by having a series of pre-meetings before the actual
[00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:51.520]   meeting. While I may have my doubts about Jack, others don't seem to. Consider entrepreneur and
