[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.280]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from September 24th, 2014 titled "Average
[00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:09.680]   Contract Duration and SaaS Renewals, All Is Not As It Appears." Chatting with some SaaS
