[00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:20.720]   data.
[00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:23.960]   Do companies use survivor biased calculations in real life?
[00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:28.000]   Let's look at my post on the Hortonworks S1 where I quote how they calculate their
