[00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:33.800]   We calculate dollar-based net expansion rate as of a given date as the aggregate annualized
[00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:37.960]   subscription contract value as of that date from those customers that were also customers
[00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:42.120]   as of the date 12 months prior, divided by the aggregate annualized subscription contract
[00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:45.200]   value from all customers as of the date 12 months prior.
