[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.440]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from June 12th, 2015 titled "The Second
[00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:08.480]   Agenda, Why No Executive Should Ever Have One."
[00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.120]   Sometimes leaders have second agendas, CEO.
[00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.320]   I want to win for my shareholders and prove I can take a company public.
[00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:18.560]   Founder, I want to win for my shareholders and destroy the great evil at Microsoft.
[00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.680]   Volleyball coach, I want to win the league and prove to the world that I can convert
[00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.080]   an average outside hitter into a great libero.
[00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.000]   CMO, I want to beat the planned targets and develop my protege.
