[00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:50.200]   The volleyball coach might lose the game by not playing the best players to win it.
[00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:54.400]   The CMO might miss planned targets by focusing more on his or her protege than on delivering
[00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.000]   MQLs to sales.
[00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.960]   This is, of course, not to argue that leaders can only focus on one goal.
[00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:04.080]   Running a company requires a whole set of goals that nap across the organ, asation.
[00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:08.000]   But leaders should have one mission, one cause, one agenda, to win.
