[00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:35.960]   The volleyball coach is seen as subjective and someone who plays favorites and thus fails
[00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:39.100]   to recruit top players to his or her team in following years.
[00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:43.680]   The CMO is seen as following years and following years, seen as political and his team.
[00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.160]   Starts to distrust his motivations for assigning projects, leading to general distrust on the
