[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.840]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from June 5th, 2016 titled, "Whose team is it,
[00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:11.040]   anyway? The 90-day rule." Say you're an experienced executive joining a new company.
[00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:15.760]   When you start, you inherit a team of people. The first thing you must realize is that over time,
[00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.080]   the team will silently transform into your team. Words and all, you're going to fully
[00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:23.920]   own that team at some point in time. In the beginning, you might boast about the stars
