[00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.120]   I have but one father, and you are it."
[00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.600]   If you've not checked lately, the roles of father and buddy are quite different.
[00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.280]   And as my father, you have a number of responsibilities that I'm counting on you to fulfill, so
[00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:43.520]   let's please stop muddying up the waters with this buddy business before it does irreparable
