[00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:06.160]   it comes to work matters, or you are going to be an authority figure, someone up the
[00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:09.840]   hierarchy and with some power distance as a result.
[00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:14.360]   Hierarchies exist for a reason and love them, curse them, or both - virtually every company
[00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:17.960]   today is organized on some variation of a hierarchy.
[00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:21.740]   Buddy managers abdicate their responsibility to be leader in charge in favor of trying
