[00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:02.560]   but I'm sure it's no problem.
[00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:05.840]   Those couldn't have been our scores in the evaluation.
[00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:08.960]   Everybody loves us. There must be some kind of mistake.
[00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:12.320]   They did say they expected to be illegal now on the original timeline,
