[00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:18.160]   Yes, I know our sponsor seemed to have flipped on us in the last meeting,
[00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.320]   but I'm sure she was just having a bad day.
[00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:23.280]   Well, I'm surprised to hear our competitor just met with the CIO
