[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.520]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from April 18th, 2017 titled "Do You
[00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:10.960]   Want to be Judged on Intentions or Results?" It was early in my career, maybe eight years in,
[00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.600]   and I was director of product marketing at a startup. One day, my peer, the director of
[00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:19.840]   marketing programs, hit me with this in an ops review meeting. "You want to be judged on
