[00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.440]   "Am I standing up arguing about mitigating factors and how things might have been when
[00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.960]   all the other people in the room were thinking only about black and white results?"
[00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:37.200]   It was one of those rare phrases that really stuck with me because, among other reasons,
[00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:42.400]   he was so right. I wasn't debating whether things happened or not. I wasn't making excuses or being
