[00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:54.480]   here, no doubt. Sometimes reasons are reasons, and sometimes they are actually excuses. The question
[00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:59.360]   isn't about any one case. It's about, deep down, are you judging yourself by intentions? It's about,
[00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:03.680]   deep down, are you judging yourself by intentions or results? You'd be surprised how many otherwise
[00:02:03.680 --> 00:02:08.320]   very solid people get this one thing wrong, and end up career limited as a result.
