[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.760]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from August 14, 2017 titled "Are you a
[00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:11.200]   challenging or simply a difficult direct report?" Most managers, save for true sycophants, want to
[00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.760]   challenge their boss. Few managers want to be puppet "yes" people to the boss. They've worked
[00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.840]   hard to get where they are. They bring years of wisdom and experience. They want to push and
