[00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:29.760]   In company 1, the CEO and VP of sales are both tied to the same number. That is, the CEO has no
[00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:34.800]   cushion if the VP of sales misses, and the VP of sales takes all of the cushion, giving the sales
