[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.280]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from January 19, 2019 titled "An Update
[00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:07.960]   on the SaaS Rule of 40."
[00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:13.480]   Thanks to the folks at Piper Jaffray and their recently published 2018 Software Market Review,
[00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:17.600]   we can take a look at a recent chart that plots public software company enterprise value,
[00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:22.960]   EV versus Rule of 40, Rule of 40, scores-free cash, free cash flow margin, press revenue
[00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.280]   growth rate.
[00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:28.760]   As a reminder, the Rule of 40 is an industry rule of thumb that says a high-growth SaaS
