[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from June 2, 2019 titled The Market Leader Play,
[00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.120]   How to Run It, How to Respond. Business to business, B2B high technology markets are all
[00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:15.760]   about the market and only less so about the technology. This is primarily driven by corporate
[00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.560]   buyer conservatism. Corporate buyers hate to make mistakes in purchasing technology and, if you're
[00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.720]   going to make one, it's far better to be in the herd with everyone else, collectively fooled,
